/-!
# A115010

Array read by antidiagonals: let V(m,n) = Sum_{i=1..m, j=1..n, gcd(i,j)=1} (m+1-i)*(n+1-j), then T(m,n) = 2*m*n+m+n+2*V(m,n), for m >= 1, n >= 1.

The 60 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A115010

